          0
        ]
      },
      "exploration-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81": {
        "id": "exploration-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
        "title": "ETag validation and 304 responses in depth",
        "summary": "Conditional request with If-None-Match returns 304 to reuse cache or 200 with new body and ETag when changed.",
        "parentId": "root",
        "source": {
          "explorationId": "root",
          "messageId": "answer-smoke-f094a2f1-2b36-4614-84ae-dc8919ce878f",
          "sectionId": "section-smoke-f094a2f1-2b36-4614-84ae-dc8919ce878f-1",
          "quote": "Server previously sent ETag: \"abc123\""
        },
        "messages": [
          {
            "id": "question-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
            "role": "user",
            "requestId": "smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
            "source": {
              "explorationId": "root",
              "messageId": "answer-smoke-f094a2f1-2b36-4614-84ae-dc8919ce878f",
              "sectionId": "section-smoke-f094a2f1-2b36-4614-84ae-dc8919ce878f-1",
              "quote": "Server previously sent ETag: \"abc123\""
            },
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "prompt-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
                "title": "",
                "body": "Explore this selected idea in a separate, deeper topic: walk through ETag validation, 304 responses, and what changes when the resource changes. Include a tiny request/response example."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "answer-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
            "role": "assistant",
            "requestId": "smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
            "source": {
              "explorationId": "root",
              "messageId": "answer-smoke-f094a2f1-2b36-4614-84ae-dc8919ce878f",
              "sectionId": "section-smoke-f094a2f1-2b36-4614-84ae-dc8919ce878f-1",
              "quote": "Server previously sent ETag: \"abc123\""
            },
            "routing": {
              "decision": "branch",
              "reason": "Separate deep dive on ETag validation keeps the overview clean."
            },
            "model": "muse-spark-1.3",
            "context": {
              "fullIds": [
                "root"
              ],
              "summaryIds": [],
              "truncated": false
            },
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81-0",
                "title": "1. ETag validation flow",
                "body": "An `ETag` is an opaque validator the server assigns to a specific version of a resource:\n\n- First response includes `ETag: \"abc123\"`\n- Browser stores body + ETag together\n- When the cached entry becomes stale, the browser does not discard it immediately. It sends a **conditional request** with `If-None-Match: \"abc123\"`\n\nThis asks: \"Send the full body only if it no longer matches this version.\""
              },
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81-1",
                "title": "2. Unchanged resource: 304 Not Modified",
                "body": "If the resource is unchanged, the server sends no body:\n\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 304 Not Modified\nCache-Control: max-age=60\nETag: \"abc123\"\n```\n\nMeaning:\n- Reuse your stored body\n- Reset the freshness clock using the new `Cache-Control` header\n- Saves bandwidth and is faster than a full 200\n\nA `304` must not contain a message-body, but may update cache metadata like `Cache-Control`, `ETag`, or `Expires`."
              },
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81-2",
                "title": "3. Changed resource: 200 with new ETag",
                "body": "If bytes, version, or relevant metadata changed, the validator will not match:\n\n```http\nHTTP/1.1 200 OK\nCache-Control: max-age=60\nETag: \"def456\"\nContent-Length: 18432\n[binary body...]\n```\n\nThe browser must:\n1. Replace the cached body\n2. Replace old ETag `\"abc123\"` with `\"def456\"`\n3. Restart freshness from zero\n\nIn short: **304 = keep cache, 200 = replace cache.**\n\nTiny complete round-trip:\n```http\nGET /logo.png\nIf-None-Match: \"abc123\"\n```\nUnchanged → `304`, use cache. Changed → `200 + ETag: \"def456\"`, store new copy."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "question-smoke-4e2ab87c-9d52-4db7-b981-d61c8da86fdf",
            "role": "user",
            "requestId": "smoke-4e2ab87c-9d52-4db7-b981-d61c8da86fdf",
            "source": null,
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "prompt-smoke-4e2ab87c-9d52-4db7-b981-d61c8da86fdf",
                "title": "",
                "body": "Quick clarification: does a 304 response normally include the full representation body? Answer in one short section."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "answer-smoke-4e2ab87c-9d52-4db7-b981-d61c8da86fdf",
            "role": "assistant",
            "requestId": "smoke-4e2ab87c-9d52-4db7-b981-d61c8da86fdf",
            "source": null,
            "routing": {
              "decision": "continue",
              "reason": "Short direct clarification fits the current topic."
            },
            "model": "muse-spark-1.3",
            "context": {
              "fullIds": [
                "exploration-smoke-e688ec7b-17dd-4ba8-ad08-5332c3004a81",
                "root"
              ],
              "summaryIds": [],
              "truncated": false
            },
            "sections": [
              {
                "id": "section-smoke-4e2ab87c-9d52-4db7-b981-d61c8da86fdf-0",
                "title": "304 has no body",
                "body": "No. A `304 Not Modified` **must not contain the full representation body**.\n\nIt tells the browser: \"your cached copy is still good, reuse it.\" It may include headers that update cache metadata, such as `Cache-Control`, `ETag`, or `Expires`, but saves bandwidth by omitting the body."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
